msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gateVerdictFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gateVerdict is functional"
msgstr "gateVerdict 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gateVerdictFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gateVerdict is functional: a gmeow:ConsumerImprovementGate carries exactly one verdict value, since that single held-or-not verdict is what decides whether the gate authorizes activation. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gateVerdict 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ConsumerImprovementGate 恰好携带一个裁定值，正是这唯一的成立与否裁定，决定该关卡是否授权激活。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hardConstraintClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "hardConstraintClass is functional"
msgstr "hardConstraintClass 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hardConstraintClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hardConstraintClass is functional: a gmeow:VerifierVerdict has exactly one gmeow:ConstraintHardness — hard or soft — the single axis the orthogonality gates read to decide winner-eligibility. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hardConstraintClass 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:VerifierVerdict 恰好具有一个 gmeow:ConstraintHardness——硬性或软性——这是正交性关卡读取以判定获胜资格的唯一轴。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectionDeterminismFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "projectionDeterminism is functional"
msgstr "projectionDeterminism 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectionDeterminismFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectionDeterminism is functional: a gmeow:ProjectionReceipt carries exactly one determinism declaration, positively asserted so that non-determinism is never left silent."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectionDeterminism 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ProjectionReceipt 恰好携带一个确定性声明,并且是正面断言的,以确保非确定性绝不会被默默略过。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectionKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "projectionKind is functional"
msgstr "projectionKind 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/projectionKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectionKind is functional: a gmeow:ProjectionReceipt is exactly one projection shape — the single kind that folds into the receipt's content digest and selects which disclosure gates bite. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectionKind 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ProjectionReceipt 恰好是一种投影形态——这一单一类型会折入该回执的内容摘要,并决定哪些披露门限生效。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "receiptKind is functional"
msgstr "receiptKind 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:receiptKind is functional: a gmeow:LifecycleReceipt records exactly one decision kind. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:receiptKind 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:LifecycleReceipt 恰好记录一种决策类型。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierOutcomeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verifierOutcome is functional"
msgstr "verifierOutcome 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierOutcomeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:verifierOutcome is functional: a gmeow:VerifierVerdict has exactly one outcome value — the single held / not-held / undetermined result the hard-failure gate keys on. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:verifierOutcome 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:VerifierVerdict 恰好具有一个结果值——即硬失败门禁所依据的唯一「成立/不成立/未确定」结果。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/strictlyOverIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:strictlyOver never relates a subject to itself; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:strictlyOver 绝不将主体关联到自身 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/strictlyOverIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a self-edge is meaningful — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当自环是有意义的时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/strictlyOverIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:strictlyOver, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:strictlyOver, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/strictlyOverIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:strictlyOverIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:strictlyOver ."
msgstr "gmeow:strictlyOverIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:strictlyOver ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/equivalenceSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:preferentiallyEquivalentWith holds in both directions; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:preferentiallyEquivalentWith 在两个方向上都成立 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

